              <svg class="pq-caption-icon" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="256" cy="256" r="192" style="fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-miterlimit:10;stroke-width:32px"/><line x1="256" y1="240" x2="256" y2="360" style="fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-width:32px"/><circle cx="256" cy="169" r="26" fill="currentColor"/></svg>
              Every park, in depth
            </h3>
            <p>Every park's profile is packed &mdash; a real description, hours and entrance fees, a 7-day weather forecast, directions to get there, on-site activities, and a feed of other visitors' posts from that exact park.</p>
            <p>Then log your own visit right there: dates, weather, who joined, which hikes you did, and highlights. Upload a GPX file and any hike becomes real stats &mdash; distance, elevation gain, and the route traced right on the map.</p>
          </div>
