          <div class="pq-caption pq-caption-5" data-pq-caption="5">
            <h3>
              <svg class="pq-caption-icon" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M256,56 303,191.3 446.2,194.2 332.1,280.7 373.6,417.8 256,336 138.4,417.8 179.9,280.7 65.8,194.2 209,191.3 Z" style="fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-width:28px"/></svg>
              Collect every stamp
            </h3>
            <p>Every visit adds a real stamp to your passport &mdash; trips, states, bucket list, and badges, all tracked as the collection grows.</p>
            <p>Badges unlock the moment your stats hit their condition &mdash; no claiming required &mdash; and new ones get added over time, so the collection keeps growing even after you've seen all 63 parks.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="pq-caption pq-caption-6" data-pq-caption="6">
            <h3>
              <svg class="pq-caption-icon" viewBox="0 0 512 512" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M344,144c-3.92,52.87-44,96-88,96s-84.15-43.12-88-96c-4-55,35-96,88-96S348,90,344,144Z" style="fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-width:32px"/><path d="M256,304c-87,0-175.3,48-191.64,138.6C62.39,453.52,68.57,464,80,464H432c11.44,0,17.62-10.48,15.65-21.4C431.3,352,343,304,256,304Z" style="fill:none;stroke:currentColor;stroke-miterlimit:10;stroke-width:32px"/></svg>
              Your profile, your trail
            </h3>
            <p>Stats, badges, and every recent stamp you've collected &mdash; a running record of everywhere you've been.</p>
            <p>Your profile's public by username, so friends (or anyone) can pull it up and see your stats and badge case at a glance &mdash; the same visit history that powers your spot in their friend suggestions.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" id="pq-keep-scrolling" class="pq-keep-scrolling" aria-label="Scroll to the next screen">
          <span>Scroll for more</span>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
            <path d="M6 9l6 6 6-6" />
          </svg>
        </button>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- position:fixed, hugging the true viewport edge — not part of the
           grid, so it isn't bounded by the grid's own max-width/padding.
